{"id":"0399f7532457c99d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ct-equiv.md","title":"Turing 可计算与 μ-递归的等价","display":"thm-ct-equiv — Turing 可计算与 μ-递归的等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ct-equiv","aliases":["20-thm-ct-equiv"],"display":"thm-ct-equiv — Turing 可计算与 μ-递归的等价","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 17.2.5 及其后的模型等价讨论","source_pdf_pages":[261],"source_printed_pages":[234],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pr]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ct-equiv"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ct-equiv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ct-equiv — Turing 可计算与 μ-递归的等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 17.2.5 及其后的模型等价讨论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>261</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>234</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_k\\)</span> 分别为机器与闭包定义的部分函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ct\\text{-}equiv}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ct\\text{-}equiv}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>论证分两向：有限机器程序的配置与计算历史可原始递归编码，再最小化寻找停止历史；反向逐一构造基础函数、复合、原始递归与严格最小化的机器子程序。该结论比较两个形式模型，可作数学定理；Church–Turing 论题另涉及非形式的“有效可算”。原 λ、Markov 等未定义对象从当前断言移除；它们的等价需要各自完整模型定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 17.2.5 及其后的模型等价讨论；印刷页 234；PDF 第 261 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ct\\text{-}equiv}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k.","display":true}],"bytes":1383,"backlinks":[{"id":"88191d3e06281669","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-ct-equiv]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-ct-equiv]] — 章 17；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-ct-equiv]]"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e","a197f5a4c2eb61dc"]}